  "reproduction": "These are public, anonymous observations without source checkouts or form submissions.\nsession/ preserves the original frozen evidence, skills, reviews and scoring inputs.\nwork/ preserves setup context, tasks, failed review attempts, explicit resolutions and separate energy/annual enrichment.\npublication/ preserves the report inputs and reproduction receipt.\nThe collection revision is recorded in session/receipt.json.\nUse implementation revision e7d1137f88160224792f206d592ba5df789b4db6 for report rendering; it also reproduces the same scores.\nThe publication render command is in publication/supplements/report-receipt.json. Run from the repository root.\nRecalculation of saved evidence is reproducible; fresh browsing or model judgments can differ.\nGreenFrame is a resource-counter energy model, separately sampled with an older browser. W3C failures are unavailable.\nAbsolute original paths are provenance, not dependencies for reading this archive.\n",
